00:40:07,980 --> 00:40:10,170
AS DAA HROME ECHEY NEESHT AS SHIAULLEY VEIH

643
00:40:10,170 --> 00:40:13,710
TOSHIAGHT GYS JERREY ORROO T'EH CROGHEY ER YN

644
00:40:13,710 --> 00:40:16,139
VOAYL CONCRAID AMAZON SOIT SY VAATEY

645
00:40:17,250 --> 00:40:19,320
MY VEES Y CHRONK SNAUEE AS Y SHIAULL

646
00:40:19,590 --> 00:40:23,880
ER CHEUVEEALLOO JEHN FINN STIUREE SHEN KAYT MY

647
00:40:23,880 --> 00:40:26,009
VEES EH GOLL MAGH HARRISH Y FINN STIUREE

648
00:40:26,130 --> 00:40:27,329
SHEN YIALL

649
00:40:28,469 --> 00:40:30,960
MY VUMMIG GREAT APRONS NEUYEEAGH RHYM MISH YN

650
00:40:30,960 --> 00:40:34,920
SLEIH MAGH-OLLISH JERREY VEADER ER YIALL MY VEES

651
00:40:34,980 --> 00:40:37,320
TREE CROMIUM NY SHLEE NA SHEN EC BAILLOO

652
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:39,840
T'AD GRA AMAZON RISH Y TRASS CHROYM VEIH'N

653
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:44,519
VOGHT ER YIOLE KETCH NY DANDER SINCROANIT SKEEREY

654
00:40:44,519 --> 00:40:47,880
SJERREE TAYM JEH YN DAA JEU T'AYN TA'N

655
00:40:47,969 --> 00:40:50,519
SHIAULL MISHNA KEITH MYSH LIEH WOOD YN SHIAULL

656
00:40:50,519 --> 00:40:53,550
MOOAR AS SHIAULL MYSH NY YIALL MYSH KERROO

657
00:40:53,550 --> 00:40:55,980
JEH SHIAULL MOOAR NY NY SMOO NA SHEN

658
00:40:56,820 --> 00:40:59,490
VA CROYM MISHNA DANDER LIORISH Y PHIAN STIUREE

659
00:40:59,489 --> 00:41:02,519
AS SHIAULL TROORANE Y CHAAYR TA'N COONTAE GRA

660
00:41:02,519 --> 00:41:05,820
DY NEE CHEER SCOADEY CHANDRA CRIGGAD NA PUMKIN

661
00:41:05,820 --> 00:41:08,400
EH WELL CHA NEL MEE FEGOOISH HO RO

662
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:08,760
VIE

663
00:41:15,420 --> 00:41:17,519
ER Y CHEAYN MYR VA SHIN AYNS GLARE

664
00:41:17,519 --> 00:41:20,039
NY GEILL Y CHEAYRT SHOH FASTYR JEDOONEE

665
00:41:21,090 --> 00:41:23,129
AS TA SHEN CUR LESH SHIN GYS JERREY

666
00:41:23,130 --> 00:41:26,130
PHODCHREELEY SHOH VA SHOH VOISH ABBYR SHEN REESHT

667
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,739
SLIENNOO SESSAL

668
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:37,709
ISMISEAILEAN JOINAGH AS BLEIN VIE NOA VOYM

669
00:41:38,789 --> 00:41:41,970
AFORESAID INJIL YNLHOAMEY VEAGH AMAZING

670
00:41:43,170 --> 00:41:45,989
ELLEY LHIAMLHIAT CHENGEY FODDEE TA LHIATTEE HIE ER

671
00:41:45,989 --> 00:41:46,319
MAYRN

672
00:41:47,730 --> 00:41:49,829
RY HOI LHIETTAL HEOSE ER DTY HIE FEEL

673
00:41:49,829 --> 00:41:54,029
ANYTHING WHATEVER HOSHIAGHT HUG EH FO SHOH ISAIAH

674
00:41:54,750 --> 00:41:57,989
BERLIN IS LAA HIE YN PHOSSAN SHOH

675
00:42:01,469 --> 00:42:02,730
IRISHMAN BY VIE

